  "North American Standards & Bill Splitting": "Normes internationales et partage équitable",
  "In the United States and Canada, restaurant dining tipping standards range from 15% for adequate service, 18% for solid service, to 20% or more for outstanding service. Traditional etiquette recommends calculating tip percentages on the pre-tax food and beverage subtotal.": "En France, le service est inclus dans l'addition. En Amérique du Nord, un pourboire de 15 à 20 % avant taxes est d'usage au restaurant.",
  "Split Bill Calculation": "Formule de partage de la note",
